## Appendix: YAML Schema Examples

### Example 1: Simple Single-Agent Workflow
```yaml
agents:
  - name: code-reviewer
    description: Reviews Rust code for issues
    llm:
      provider: "ollama"
      model: "llama3.2:7b"
    tools:
      - file-read
      - grep

workflow:
  - step: Review main.rs
    agent: code-reviewer
    input:
      file: "./src/main.rs"
      issues: "memory safety, error handling"
```

### Example 2: Multi-Agent Parallel Workflow
```yaml
agents:
  - name: analyzer
    llm:
      provider: "lmstudio"
      model: "phi-3"
    tools:
      - file-search
      - file-read

  - name: researcher
    llm:
      provider: "lmstudio"
      model: "phi-3"
    tools:
      - web-fetch
      - web-scrape

workflow:
  - step: Parallel analysis
    parallel: true
    tasks:
      - name: Local analysis
        agent: analyzer
        input:
          path: "./src/"
      - name: External research
        agent: researcher
        input:
          url: "https://docs.rs/tokio"
```

